/P 160 0 R
/E (Well, it's happened before. The Torah tells us all about it. That's pretty much what the book of Genesis is about. And we are the robots. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
351 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (G-d created human beings, gave us intelligence and free choice, and look what happened. Adam and Eve disobeyed their very first instruction. Cain murdered his brother. Within ten generations, humanity had become so corrupt that the world needed a Flood. And not long after that, mankind united to build the Tower of Babel in an attempt to challenge heaven.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
