355 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (Commentators note that the rainbow indicates the purification and refinement that the world underwent by means of the Flood. Before the Flood the clouds were very coarse, thus preventing a reflection of sunlight. Thereafter, however, the clouds became more refined; they reflected sunlight, thus bringing about a rainbow.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
356 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (This, then, is the connection between the rainbow and the future redemption: The entire world will attain the peak of refinement with the coming of Moshiach.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
